WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.400
Likewise, in a period of just seven months,

00:00:02.400 --> 00:00:06.440
I have ended seven unendable wars.

00:00:06.440 --> 00:00:08.400
They said they were unendable.

00:00:08.400 --> 00:00:10.240
You're never going to get them solved.

00:00:10.240 --> 00:00:13.040
Some were going for 31 years.

00:00:13.040 --> 00:00:15.540
Two of them, 31. Think of it, 31 years.

00:00:15.540 --> 00:00:16.879
One was 36 years.

